<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">2Teselonqqe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Teselonqe Asayis xaafeez Nam77inth Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Teselonqqe</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tes.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Teselonqqe Asayis Xaafeez Nam7intho Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiristtoosa nam7intho yi7ithayil afa denddeez oychchay palama medhdhittar yhanigeez gishos Teselonqqe woosa keetha meto gaanggittar gaanggittar qiteeza. Phawuloosa Teselonqqe asayis xaafeez nam7intha kiitay, «Goda yi7ith gallasay ukkeeza» yeegiz ammano timirttayil afa miinthii odiza. Phawuloosa odittar Kiristtoosa ye7odaypp tiina, «Zhuca atha» ginttinttiz Kiristtoosana ixxizay kaalithizay yha alamel afa iitatithinnee cubotithii gaanggittar yhanigoda yeegiz u ammana luulisiza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaaray, metonnee waaye gaanggikoka unttii fa ammanayid minggoday garkk eenne ezar wolla yezitay ootheezay garkk, unttii fa yessis beeziza baz denggodayis miinggii yhanttoday garkk ma lo77o ooso oothodayis guye gaamay garkk unttan miinthii zoriza.</para>
  <para style="iot">2 Teselonqqe kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galatannee maganth <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa nam7intho yi7ithi bagga inggintteez timirtte <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-17">2:1-17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammanor yessal afa inggintteez zore <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3:1-15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuste qofannee sarotho <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3:16-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Phawuloosapp, Silaaseppennee Ximaatoosappe Teselonqqe woosa keetha yez ammaniza asayis, Xoossa Aday baggannee Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa bagga maaqqeez asayis xaafeez kiita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Haw. O. 17:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="2TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Xooss nu Adayppenne Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosapp aadho keehatithaynnee sarotithay yinttis maaqqo.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa nam7antho yi7ithayid ingginttod pirdda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Nu ishuntho, yi ammanannee yi woli siiqiza siiqqay lo7ithii dicciza gishos nuunii yeyis Xoossa ubba wode galatiza, galatodayiskka beeziza <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Yinttan helleez bayi7ithayidannee waaye ubbay garzhorannee ammanor miinggii eqqeez gishos nuunii nu ommas Xooss woosa keetha yi bagga markkattittar yinttal ceeqinttiza.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Yi E gishos gi meto ekkiz Xooss kaatetithayis beezizita maaqqii taybinttoday garkk Xooss geeshsha pirddayis yhayi malla. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Xoossii tuma pirdda pirddoda. Xoossii yinttan waayisizitayil afa waaye ki7i u gata ciggoda. <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>Goda Yesuusa fa wolqqama kiitanchchitayra ye7ii yhatti waayinttiza yinttanannee nuna shemppisoda. <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>E laxiz tamar benttoda, Ma Xoossii fana erowazitannee nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggelayis kiitinttoowazita eexiz tamar pirddoda. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Unttii Goday tiinapennee e bonchcho wolqqapp shaakinttii medhina dhabor pirddinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Isa. 2:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>Ye gallas, E faasitayrannee fana ammanizita ubbayil bonchchinttodayisinnee sabinttodayis ye7odar nu yinttis odeez kiita yi ammaneez gishos yi eza bonchchizitay ganccennee sabbizitay gancce payidinttoda.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Nuunii yinttis ubba wode qofa gachchekkazar Xoossii woossizay yeyisii. Nu Xoossii yinttan xeegeez xeegithayis beezizita maaqqii payidinttoday garkk woossiza. Yi lo77o baz oothodayis amottiza amannee yi ammano oosa E fa wolqqar folo. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Ezayid nu Xoossannee nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa aath keehatithayid, Goda Yesuusa suntha yi bonchchoda; yinttanakka E bonchchinttoday garkk nu woossiza.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Wuce as</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Nu ishuntho, nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa yi7ithi baggannee nu eza hellodayis shiiqobagga nu yinttan woossiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Isa. 2:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>Tinbbiter woy qaala si7eezay garkk woy nuuppe ekkeez kiita udii, «Goda gallasay helleeza» yeegii yi wozinay dagammipennee dhabippe. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Yinttan oonkka aba ogerakka balithippe. Tiinattii asay Xoossa kado aykkekkazin wuce athay zhucatithay qonccekkannee dhabos beeziza athay ye7ekkazin, Goday gallasay hellaamii. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Yha wuce athay god giinttii goyinttiz ubbaypp aathii pana dhoqi udoda. Hara attozin yasha bayth, Xooss kara gelii bettii, «Taanii Xoosse» goda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Daan. 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:2">Iziqe. 28:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Taanii yinttar yezar yinttis odeezana akaakoosanee? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Yha wuce athay fa gallasar ye7odaypp attin yhatti ye7aamay garkk abii eza kayizako yi eriza.<verse eid="2TH 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Asayis benttekkazar wuce athay wolqqay yhattekka geemar oothiza, maaqqozin yhatti eza kayizay yeza. Eza kayizay ogellap hali7od hellodayis E benttaamii. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Yeypp guye, wuce athay benttoda, zin Goda Yesuusa fa doonaypp keziz peenayirannee fa yi7ithay deetayir eza dhabisoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:4">Isa. 11:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Wuce athay Xalahe wolqqar yi7ii balithiza mallitannee malabazita udoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mat. 24:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>Yey garkkekka, dhabos yez asita duma duma dooshiza iita oosor balithoda. Unttikka dhabizay ashshiza tumana dosii ekkaam ixxeez gishosii. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Yeyi gishos, unttii worddo ammanoday garkk Xoossii iita balitho wolqqa unttal afa dakkoda. <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>Yeykka, tuma ammanaam gi, nagara oosor ufayttiza ubbay pirddinttoday garkkesii.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atotithis doorintteez asita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Goday dosiza nu ishuntho, nuunii Xoossa yi gishos ubba wode galatodayis beeziza. Galatizaykka yi attoday garkk Geeshsha Ayyana wolqqar yinttan geeshsheezannee yinttikka tuma ammanii attoday garkk E yinttan bayrathii dooreeza. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Xoossii, nu yinttis odeez Wonggilay baggar yinttan xeegeezay, yi nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosar wola bonchchinttoday garkke. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Yikkee, nu ishuntho, miinggii eqqoytta. Nuunii yinttan doonar woy dabddaabber taamarsseez timirtta miinthii aykkoytta.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>E nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosannee nuna qadhdhii nuus fa aadho keehetithar medhina minthathonnee lo77o ufayss Xooss Aday nuus inggeeza. <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>Yi ubba wode lo77o baz oothodayisinnee odinttodayis E minthathoday garkkennee maaddoday garkk nu Goda Xoossa nu Ada woossoda.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Woosas shiiqeez oychchi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Wurssithal nu ishuntho, Goday qaalay yi gancce ellisii dalggoday garkkennee bonchchinttoday garkk nuus woossoytta. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Yey garkkekka, qaala si7iz as ubbay ammanizita baaya yey gishos Xoossii zhucitayppennee iita asitaypp nuna ashshoday garkk nuus woossoytta.<verse eid="2TH 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Zini Goday ammaninttizaya; E yinttan minthathodannee Xalahepp naagoda. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Nuunii yinttan kiittizay yhattekka tiinapekka yi oothodaya Godayil nu yinttal ammanintteeza.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Goday yi wozina Xooss siiqokonnee Kiristtoosa danda7ayko kaalitho.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oosos azalippate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Nu ishuntho, yi nuupp ekkeez kiita kaallozitayppennee ooso dosowa azaalla ammaniza asitaypp yi shaakinttoday garkk Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthayir yinttan nu azaziza. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Nu aaziso garkk hanii yezodayis beezizana yi, yi ommas eriza. Nuunii yinttar yez wode ooso bili7ekkaya. <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>Nuunii ooppekka katha cere meekkaya. Nuus danda7intteezay garkk qammannee gallas daaburittar yenepp attin ooskka toofo maaqqekkaya. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Nuunii yeya ootheezay, yinttis aaziso maaqqodayisipp attin yinttipp maadee oycodayis nuus mawute dhabin baaya. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Nu yinttar yeza wodekka, «Yhanttodayis koyowa as oonkka miippe» yeegii azazeeza.<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Nuunii yeya geezay, yi gancce pettii pettii azallitay yeza si7eez gishos. Ye asitay gelissowa aqo gelii harita ooso bilisinepp attin aba oothokka oothooya. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Nuunii yey garkk asitay shempp wogar yessaday garkkennee paas beeziza baz fa kusher oothii demmaday garkk Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthar unttan azazizannee zoriza.<verse eid="2TH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Zini nu ishuntho, nu daabureeza gi lo77o ooso oothodayis azallipatte. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Yhatti nuunii yha dabddaabbayid kiitteez kiitayis kiitinttoowa as oonkka yeziko ye atha eroytta. E yeellatoday garkk eepp shaakinttoytta. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Zini eza ishe garkk seeroyttapp attin morkke garkk bi7ipate.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Saro Goday, fa ommas yinttis ubba wodennee ubba baggar saro ingo. Goday yinttar ubbitayir maaqqo.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Taanii Phawuloosa, yha sarotha ta kusher xaafeeza. Ta kiita ubbayis mallay yhaya; taanii yey garkk xaafiza.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatithay yinttar ubbitayir maaqqo.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
